# Package Manager: pnpm

Always use `pnpm` for dependency management.

```bash
# ✅ GOOD
pnpm install
pnpm add <package>
pnpm add -D <package>
pnpm remove <package>

# ❌ BAD
npm install
yarn add <package>
```

- Run scripts with `pnpm run <script>` or `pnpm <script>`
- Lock file is `pnpm-lock.yaml`, never commit `package-lock.json` or `yarn.lock`
